    "The actual59 producer takes only the original potential/Hessian/capped-step hypotheses. Its probability witnesses are installed locally. LinearIsometry.ext and Lp.ext align its M0 with the canonical pullback using each observable's AE representative action, so the later onto map transports the SAME T and kernel rather than a substituted model.",
